window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I went in search of miracles…and stumbled upon a monster instead. In return for the healing I was so desperate for, I just had to make one teensy weensie promise….</p> <p>To be his consort for, uh…forever.</p> <p>To say I wasn’t exactly thinking things through when I said yes was an understatement.</p> <p>And now I’ve been whisked away to a castle in a wintry wonderland with a ginormous, ferocious chimera. You know, lion-like head, goat horns, big freaking wings. Yeah.</p> <p>And he’s just deposited me on his bed, ready to start making good on that whole consort promise. Apparently forever starts now.</p> <p>Gulp.</p>"; 
